## Token efficiency — the first property

Every token is the owner's money. Finish the task, prove it, spend as little as possible — the
lookup ladder and the ask-first rule live in the POLARIS block above (FEWEST HOPS).

- **Prefer ONE context over three**, and the smallest check that proves the change.
- **Never name a model** — every spawn inherits the session.
- **Long, mechanical, no judgement in it?** Hand it to the human with 🚩 and ONE paste-ready block:
  one command per line, never `&&` (PowerShell has no chain operators), no placeholders.

Added by `polaris heal`. Edit freely — it is appended once and never rewritten.
